---
title: "transfer (Compound V2: cToken)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_comptroller: transferAllowed(cToken, src, dst, amount)
    q_comptroller --> q_reject: comptroller rejects
    q_reject --> [*]: return TRANSFER_COMPTROLLER_REJECTION
    q_comptroller --> q_balance_check: comptroller allows
    q_balance_check --> q_insufficient: accountTokens[src] < amount
    q_insufficient --> [*]: return TRANSFER_NOT_ENOUGH
    q_balance_check --> q_update: accountTokens[src] >= amount
    q_update --> q_emit: accountTokens[src] -= amount; accountTokens[dst] += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Transfer(src, dst, amount); return true

    note right of q_comptroller
        INV-001: Transfer fails if src has entered market and transfer causes negative liquidity
        INV-002: Comptroller.transferAllowed checks account liquidity after hypothetical transfer
    end note

    note right of q_update
        INV-003: Total supply unchanged by transfer (conservation)
        INV-004: src balance decreases by amount, dst balance increases by amount
    end note
